libwebp
https://chromium.googlesource.com/webm/libwebp
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Classes in dev.simplified.image.codec.webp.vp8:
  - VP8Tables: the keyframe token tree and the coefficient and mode
    probabilities (src/dec/tree_dec.c)
  - VP8Costs: the bit-cost tables and residual-cost estimation
    (src/enc/cost_enc.c, src/enc/cost_enc.h)
  - QuantMatrix, TrellisQuantizer: the quantizer bias and sharpening
    matrices and TrellisQuantizeBlock (src/enc/quant_enc.c)
  - DCT: the forward and inverse DCT and Walsh-Hadamard transforms
    (src/dsp/enc.c, src/dsp/dec.c)
  - LoopFilter: the edge filters and the filter-strength setup
    (src/dsp/dec.c, src/dec/frame_dec.c)
  - VP8TokenEncoder, VP8TokenDecoder: PutCoeffs (src/enc/frame_enc.c)
    and GetCoeffsFast (src/dec/vp8_dec.c)
  - ChromaUpsampler: the fancy chroma upsampler (src/dsp/upsampling.c,
    src/dec/io_dec.c)

Classes in dev.simplified.image.codec.webp.vp8l:
  - NearLosslessPreprocess: near-lossless preprocessing
    (src/enc/near_lossless_enc.c)
  - LZ77, VP8LEncoder: the plane-code tables and the code-length code
    order (src/enc/backward_references_enc.c)

